    "name": "Latch — hand the protocol from the Safe to the timelocks",
    "description": "8 transferOwnership calls plus 7 timelock schedule() calls. The schedules start the delay clock in the SAME transaction, so no second round trip is needed before the wait begins. Custody 48h: Vault, both pool manager owners. Policy 6h: both protocol fee controllers, the Latch fee controller, the position descriptor, the router. CLPositionDescriptor is plain Ownable so it transfers immediately and needs no accept.",
